; Fixture for the --wasm-list-macro snapshot test (src/snapshot_tests.rs::wasm_list_macro).
; Covers every reachable (needs_into, is_copy) combination for Vec<T>-backed list wrappers,
; the c-style-enum edge, and the Optional fall-back-to-inline path:
;   foos   -> list of struct         -> impl_wasm_list!(.., true,  false)
;   nested -> list of list           -> impl_wasm_list!(.., true,  false)
;   nums   -> list of copy primitive -> impl_wasm_list!(.., false, true)
;   texts  -> list of string         -> impl_wasm_list!(.., false, false)
;   colors -> list of c-style enum   -> impl_wasm_list!(.., false, true)  (rust==wasm re-exported type)
;   maybes -> list of optional       -> stays INLINE (predicate returns None; the fall-back guard)
; ((true, true) is unreachable: only primitives/enums are Copy, and neither needs .into().)
foo = [uint]
foos = [* foo]
texts = [* text]
nums = [* uint]
nested = [* texts]
color = 0 / 1 / 2
colors = [* color]
maybe = text / null
maybes = [* maybe]
